WEBVTT

00:10:59.238 --> 00:11:01.073
to start having more fun.

00:11:02.533 --> 00:11:04.201
[Roast a Turkey]
I am just kidding.

00:11:04.201 --> 00:11:05.536
(Laughter)

00:11:05.536 --> 00:11:06.870
Prioritize it.

00:11:06.912 --> 00:11:08.497
That might sound totally obvious,

00:11:08.539 --> 00:11:11.125
but one of the main reasons
we're not having enough fun

00:11:11.125 --> 00:11:13.001
is that we're not making it a priority.

00:11:13.001 --> 00:11:15.087
Our fun is always
at the bottom of the list,

00:11:15.129 --> 00:11:16.714
and it can't speak up for itself.

00:11:16.714 --> 00:11:20.092
So I'm not suggesting that you take out
your calendar and make an entry

00:11:20.134 --> 00:11:23.512
that says: “From 4 to 6pm
on Saturday, I shall have fun.”

00:11:23.512 --> 00:11:25.848
That is a guaranteed way to not have fun.

00:11:26.265 --> 00:11:28.642
But if you know you consistently have fun

00:11:28.684 --> 00:11:30.936
when you spend time
with a particular person,